 "head": {
  "text": "WF-034 A node that sends a dominant bit does not resynchronize on a positive phase error"
 },
 "foot": {
  "text": "The edge arrives 4 quanta late because of the loop delay of the transmitting node itself. The transmitting node ignores it (rule 4): its bit time is not lengthened. A pure receiver sees the same edge as a phase error and lengthens PHASE_SEG1."
 }
